cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use qnmlab, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "qnmlab: black-hole quasinormal modes with quantum algorithms"
abstract: >-
  qnmlab computes black-hole quasinormal modes with quantum algorithms: a phase readout that
  reads a mode's frequency from two measured averages, a seedless search of the complex
  frequency plane with readout verification, simulated noise and mitigation, and an analysis
  path for real quantum hardware, including the raw counts of a 2026 IQM Emerald run.
version: 0.1.1
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/abir-tech/qnmlab"
url: "https://www.aiqcommunity.org/"
keywords:
  - quasinormal modes
  - black holes
  - quantum computing
  - variational quantum eigensolver
  - non-Hermitian eigenvalue problems
